{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T14:34:27.663Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"8e50ed6ddba2b59987db529b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T14:34:27.663Z","author":"pi-glm-rules","text":"Rewrote test/rules.test.ts against the corrected contract after the prior delegation tested wrong semantics and imported a removed findingFor export. Result: 11 suites, 14 tests, all pass. Every rule owns assertions on real temp SDK trackers (create/update/claim/comments/notes/close), expected values asserted literally, never derived from rule outputs. Boundaries covered: PML003 semicolon/newline splits with every criterion judged; PML004 planning vs labeled vs post-close comments plus missing/invalid closed_at; PML005 exactly-14-days not flagged, greater flagged, default and explicit staleDays, stale unclaimed in_progress and stale claims regardless of status, comments/notes/test_runs activity, terminal closed/canceled ignored; PML006 Features in any status with absent and empty files/tests arrays; PML007 whole-corpus children incl closed ones, scalar parent plus parent/epic and child/task SDK alias directions, dangling/self/related not children; PML008 punctuation/case/space folding with empty context ignored; PML009 prose and URL blockers valid, missing/self/ghost local refs flagged; PML010 pure projection of analyzeDuplicateItems membership from the certified active corpus. Focused coverage: c8 --all --include src/rules.ts --100 --reports-dir rules-coverage.local node --test test/rules.test.ts reports 100% statements, branches, functions, lines. Docstring and fleet lint gates clean on the file."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T14:34:27.663Z"}],"before_hash":"b7ddadeb73c5f4ad64c01215bb62c66190b10fc824e10a2da31242f5f0667de3","after_hash":"93c66b64762ca04435579f5b4d8286fe713e23c81a08db9e2276891901a4710d","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"59ec3169b0eaf7aff7645ff8ef4fd72c3a3262bfb877dc0e6a0d6c7453a2f724"}
